# Code Quality

- Keep systems modular; avoid giant classes.
- Keep business logic out of `PluginEditor` (C++) and out of React components.
- Never block the audio thread; never perform disk IO inside `processBlock()`.
- Use C++17.
- Prefer composition over inheritance.
- Make the architecture expandable before making it fancy.
